### Listar conductores
GET http://localhost:3000/conductores
Authorization: Bearer TU_TOKEN_AQUI

### Crear conductor
POST http://localhost:3000/conductores
Authorization: Bearer TU_TOKEN_AQUI
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Juan",
  "apellido": "Pérez",
  "numero_documento": "35123456",
  "numero_licencia": "LIC-987654",
  "fecha_alta_licencia": "2023-01-10",
  "fecha_vencimiento_licencia": "2028-01-10"
}